    toISOString() returns UTC time, not local time. You're in US Eastern (UTC-4). Right now local time is ~5:47 PM May 26, but UTC is ~9:47 PM May 26 — still May 26. But if it were after 8 PM local, UTC would be May 27. At that point todayStr() returns "2026-05-27" while your items have display_date: "2026-05-26".

